msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Everything south of Ryukyu Boulevard is the Ryudo Family's territory. Their "
"boss Nakahara-san is quite a fellow, a real old-fashioned type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"He actually cares about honor and duty. Sure, he charges us protection "
"money, but in return he keeps the big chain stores from moving in from the "
"mainland."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "It's thanks to him that we can continue to do business like this!"
msgstr ""

